# ==============================================================================
# Mosquitto MQTT Topic Access Control Lists (ACL)
# ==============================================================================
# Principle of Least Privilege:
# - Edge gateways publish telemetry to v2v/telemetry and gateway health
# - SCADA Backend subscribes to telemetry and health; publishes commands
# - Microcontrollers/vehicles subscribe only to dispatch commands
# ==============================================================================

# SCADA Central Server / Backend Account
user scada_backend
topic read v2v/telemetry
topic read v2v/gateway/health
topic write v2v/commands
topic readwrite v2v/incidents

# Edge LoRa / FLRC RF Telemetry Gateway Account
user rsu_gateway
topic write v2v/telemetry
topic write v2v/gateway/health
topic read v2v/commands

# Registered Vehicle Clients (Read broadcast alerts)
user vehicle_client
topic read v2v/commands
